{"resourceIdentifier":"2567","resourceName":"Soc Son Waste to Power Plant Project","description":"The Soc Son waste to power plant project (hereinafter “the project”) includes the construction and operation of a waste treatment plant, which is located at Nam Son waste treatment complex area, Soc Son District, Hanoi. The project is owned by Ha Noi Thien Y Environmental Energy Joint Stock Company, which was established from 3 investors including Soc Son renewable Energy Joint Stock Company, Perfect Wave Holdings Limited Company and Europe Tianying BVBA Company.\r\nThe purpose of this project activity is to treat 4,000 ton of municipal solid waste (MSW) per day and generate electricity with the installed capacity of 75 MW. The annual estimated electricity output of 388.05 GWh is supplied to the national grid via the transmission line. The Soc Son waste to power plant will use 5 Waterleau continuous grate-type incinerators for treating MSW and a combination of 5 boilers, 3 steam turbines and 3 generators to recover heat from combustion of MSW for generating electricity.\r\nThe project activity help to avoid methane release from SWDS(s) in the absence of the project activity and generate renewable electricity, which displaced part of the electricity otherwise supplied by grid connected fossil fuel fired power plants. Thus, GHG emission reductions can be achieved. The expected CO2 emission reduction from the proposed project is 486,957 tCO2e annually and 3,408,698 tCO2e in total over the first 7 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":21.340550,"longitude":105.834997},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-08-11","endExclusive":"2021-09-11","endInclusive":"2021-09-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2567"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hanoi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"544076"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"23/08/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 24/07/2022 - 23/07/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=54031&IDKEY=2iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfd74508749","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD_ver 1.0_Soc Son Waste to Power Plant Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-07-22T23:10:37.68Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=54032&IDKEY=4iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3874510128","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Presentation_Soc Son Waste to Power Plant Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-07-22T23:11:09.533Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95980&IDKEY=3q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk132356420","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS Soc Son WtE Project _PDD_ver 3.0_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-23T16:17:44.88Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82655&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df113981245","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"05_VCS Registration Deed of Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-13T00:45:32.263Z"}